Dynamic batching is learned behavior. Training a machine learning model to accept dynamic batching occurs like a skill learned once. It cannot be applied to existing data by merely static batching them during training. Rewriting the ML model is the solution to integrate with dynamic batching, or the existing model can suffer through significant pre-processing before sending to the server.

