- Thread harmonization
- Work queue and worker thread model
- When multiple workers are running concurrently, take care of shared state conflicts. Concurrent data access, acquisition, release, and propagation can cause conflicts in the state of the model, leading to occasional desynchronization.
- Overprovisioning and underprovisioning can help reach the most optimal state in the application.
- Separating servicing or inference into a distinct thread.
