* **methodId** *string* ID of the method that was benchmarked inside specific harness
* **filenames** *[]string* list of all unique file names from all benchmarks
* **shards** *int* total amount of shards that was run
* **elapsed** *float64* total time taken to execute all benchmarks (in milliseconds)
* **iteration** *int* index of iteration in map function
* **index** *int* iteration number in outer benchmarking loop
* **fileN** *string* file name
* **suiteN** *int* benchmark sue number
* **benchmark** *string* benchmark name
