* **value-n** *float64* value (per op)
* **usr-n** *float64* user time used during benchmark execution
* **sys-n** *float64* system time used during benchmark execution
* **real-n** *float64* real time taken to execute benchmark
* **tick-n** *int* timer ticks (from BSD platform)
* **op-n** *int* number of iterations to execute benchmark
* **expTime-n** *float64* expected execution time (for most benchmarks is `0`)
* **gcExpected-n** *int* gc invocations expected
* **gcInvocations-n** *int* gc invocations actually taken
* **allocationsByOperationNanoseconds** *float64* allocations done in nanoseconds per benchmark operation
* **allocationsByOperation** *int* total number of allocations per benchmark operation
