Power requirements:

Two 110/220 VAC, 15 A, 50/60 Hz power supplies
Standard 48 VDC power (suftaining 110 VAC)
Input current: 5 A (max) @ 115 VAC
Input current: 2.5 A (max) @ 230 VAC
Input voltage: +/- 10% @ 110 VAC
Input voltage: +/- 5% @ 230 VAC
