LAN - T1
WAN 1 - T1
WAN 2 - T1

Total prompts processed per second = LAN CPS + WAN 1 CPS + WAN 2 CPS. I understand the power usage per prompt, for a T1, uses a formula I am unsure of. Assuming Cisco uses the same or close to the same data rate and power usage, what formula would allow me to extrapolate power usage based on CPS? Thanks.

